# GitHub's language bar (Linguist) runs on the default branch and counts only
# files it classes as code. Markdown posts, YAML config, CSV data and images
# are all excluded already, which left the notebooks published alongside three
# posts as 80%+ of the bar -- labelling a Hugo site "Jupyter Notebook".
#
# They are reference material shipped for readers, not this project's source,
# so mark them as documentation: GitHub keeps rendering and diffing them
# normally and simply leaves them out of the language statistics.
*.ipynb linguist-documentation
